{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Publish the caller result only after MDC restoration succeeds.** Completing it in `finally` means an asynchronous restoration fatal only kills the worker while the caller can receive `SUCCEEDED`/`PENDING`; direct nonfatal failures are discarded and may leave caller MDC corrupted. Capture restoration failures, attempt a reliable clear fallback, complete the caller exceptionally, and still rethrow JVM-fatal failures on the worker.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77sbr1","finding_digest":"d43371534e39ba8ef3db8885e66b122c9182a4cc77f87519192245519be87d31","finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","line":304,"observation_digest":"55a530565a26d0ecdaceba3bab88665aebb9e5a0f89f3381101e3dd156653d09","observation_id":"aro_v1_kwstavs2e3iozwwoxi52xcdgll","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","published_at":"2026-10-08T18:31:14Z","review_id":"arr_v1_3ad56x3tucxpdx6v3vndafnqmc","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"40597b3393d2260883ae37b45d978685d2144a31","reviewer":"codex","start_line":301,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_f5ewqzo53aabtdebxguoxafdac","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T18:31:14Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
